    "detailed_description": "<strong>For video creators and streamers</strong><br>STP WORKS permits the use of our games for video distribution to YouTube and other sites, and monetization through video distribution platform partner programs.<br><br><br><strong>Game Overview</strong><br>Do you love French fries? Then this game is for you! A game where you push out fries with French fries to create a set of a burger, fries, and a drink. The goal is to fulfill as many orders as you can before you run out of HP. It's a challenge you wouldn't want to miss!<br><br><br><strong>Stick to sound effects</strong><br>We have recorded the actual sounds of fries from a famous fast food joint to use as sound effects in the game. You can enjoy a realistic and immersive potato sound experience.<br><br><br><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong><br>Enjoy both random and friend matching. You can experience a once in a lifetime meet in a random match, get excited with inside jokes in friend matching, and of course, it's also possible to play solo. Play as you prefer, and you can play with up to 4 people at the same time.<br><br><br><strong>Leaderboard</strong><br>Compete for scores with French fries lovers all over the world.<br><br><strong>Upgrade</strong><br>You can enhance various abilities using the money earned from playing the game.",
